**My Solution:**
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Random Joke Generator</title>
	<style>
		body {
			font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
			text-align: center;
		}
		
		button {
			background-color: #4CAF50;
			color: white;
			padding: 10px 20px;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 5px;
			cursor: pointer;
		}
		
